  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 305.07 Secondary Containment for AST Systems Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 305.07 Secondary Containment for AST Systems Required. No person shall construct an AST system without secondary containment for the ASTs as specified in Env-Or 305.08 and for the piping systems as specified in Env-Or 305.09.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 300) #10487, eff 2-7-14; ss by #14094, eff 10-4-24",
